Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Scurvy Been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sour aftervarit half five aftervarit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we could take a\Nwalk to the eastern hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, me, and Kirito, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fresh air would do him good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we go then, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I walk away. I walk.
