Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold them tight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he is warm enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you can be such a worrywart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bundled him up so much he's sweating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you, Gio, think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How beautiful. None of the paintings in\Nthe Cathedral can compare with this view.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved this world Kirito remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed what do\Nwe do if they cut the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,main power line now it's\Ngonna cause a surge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A light cube cluster\Nshould be safe but the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,subcomputer where Kitty\NGuy is STL is won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The surge will cook his Fluctlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll handle the lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, take Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kojiro and Asuna and\Nget to the upper shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep Kirito safe. Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're cutting the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The screw propellers are going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not after saving my life! Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're facing the biggest crisis in\Nthe history of the Axiom Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two elite disciples we\Nfought killed the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's dead? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judelkin died with the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With him gone, there's no more Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would those disciples risk\Nangering the gods with their actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stop the Pontifex before she turned\Nhalf the human realm into weapons of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an army of mindless living swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could she do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To subject the people to such horror?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's diabolical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Bercouli, where are the two\Nrogues who murdered her eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be captured and interrogated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to\Ndeal with that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Territory's been\Nitching to invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when they find out about\Nthe Pontifex, they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our ranks are half as strong thanks to\Npast battles with the forces of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all be worried about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Dark Territory decides to attack us\Nnow, the Human Realm will fall for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or rather, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we'll restore the Order\Nof the Integrity Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll muster the Imperial Knights of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Four Empires and\Ntrain them for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's strength in numbers, and right\Nnow, we need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I told you was hard to accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's still our job to\Nprotect the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir.
