Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs92\c&H000000&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(977.143,806.857)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(33,153,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(66,186,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(99,219,\alpha&H00&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(132,252,\alpha&H00&)}9{\alpha&HFF&\t(165,285,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(198,318,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(231,351,\alpha&H00&)}8{\alpha&HFF&\t(264,384,\alpha&H00&)}0 {\alpha&HFF&\t(297,417,\alpha&H00&)}({\alpha&HFF&\t(330,450,\alpha&H00&)}H{\alpha&HFF&\t(363,483,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(429,549,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(462,582,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(495,615,\alpha&H00&)}.{\alpha&HFF&\t(528,648,\alpha&H00&)})
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Kirito's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor going round, saying that\Nrebel swordsman is still alive. I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we have to prepare for\Nthe Dark Territory to invade,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but leaving that traitor in our midst?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He defied the Church and should\Nbe executed for it. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what Commander\NBacoli is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is no longer safe for Kirito here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall go to Aincrad Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they will accept us there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since it is the place where\NEugeo and I were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strangers aren't allowed\Nin unless I say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the gods, it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am no stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon Gasfut Zuburg at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really you, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been pardoned for your crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly was punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the memories I had of\Nmy life here were wiped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is not enough to absolve\Nme, no one said otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I have returned, because\NI could think of nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow a criminal to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we start heading back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Selka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something troubles you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nothing\Nserious. It's Mr. Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked if you could chop\Ndown another tree for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that's why you're so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know he and I have an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but how dare he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both him and Mr. Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't hesitate to ask you\Nfor help when they need it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they don't mind you\Nbeing shunned by the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Selka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can have a place on\Nthe outskirts, that's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but next year, my training\Nwill be done, and I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I'll be earning a little\Nmoney, I could give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but it's enough that you\Nwon't have to help those people anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Kirito don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful but having you close\Nby is all I could ever need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am happy just to have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the time it takes you\Nto cut this damn tree down,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riddick's men will have expanded his\Nland 20 miles in order - Good day, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How good of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so quickly, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you need my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been hacking away at\Nit since yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These damn platinum oak\Ntrees are tough. Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ten grown men have put\Ntheir backs into every
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,swing and they've barely\Nmade a scratch in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know our deal is for one tree a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this one's stubborn and I\Nreally need your help here, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall do it. And happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just this once, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could count on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, Kirito, I need\Nyour sword, but only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're going to cut down a\Nplatinum oak with a little old sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll snap in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:13:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd best move away from there. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Splendid. Wonderful. Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skill is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall double your compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And instead of once a month,\Nyou'd work for me once a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, once a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you could use the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but the amount you are\Npaying now is quite sufficient
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:15:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My payment oh of course yes right away
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barbosa
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else do you think\Nshe cut that tree down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone could with that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword belongs to Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he didn't want us touching it,\Nhe should have said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We asked him nicely, and all he did\Nwas go, uh, uh, like a gibbering fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a damn sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what we fought for, suffered\Nfor, to protect people like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo lost his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito is a shell of his former self.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is a point to all we've\Nbeen through, it is lost to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amayori, it seems you've\Ngained some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been gorging on too many fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night. Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat too fast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takiguri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Ayori's elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie Synthesis 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady. My mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Order has\Nbetter things to do now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than send dragons all over\Njust to track me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this, but I simply\Nfollowed the bond between our souls. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I found you by complete coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, now that I am here, I have news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goblins and orcs have\Nbeen mobilizing in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for why I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the commander ordered us to collapse\Nthe caves to the south and west and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in the north I was sent to make\Nsure the fiends hadn't dug them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and is the cave north of here safe\Nor have they dug through it i spent
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all day up there keeping a vigilant\Neye upon it in all that time i did not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spot any orcs or goblins i'm happy to\Nreport the cave is still filled with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,debris then as i made my way back to\Nthe capital takiguri began behaving
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I allowed him free rein, and\Nthis is where he chose to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your new home, and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that we've been reunited at last,\Nyou will forgive me for speaking my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice, please return to the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your sword now,\Nmore than ever, more than an
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,army of thousands!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because of that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who escaped from prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who flouted the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who raised his sword\Nagainst your fellow knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the prime senator, and the pontifex?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.60,0:20:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he still leading your
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart astray?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, there is but one\Nsolution for your confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall eliminate him at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought not for himself, but\Nfor what he believed was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that not what the\Nknighthood fights for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He defeated us one after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you fought him, surely you could\Nfeel the purity of his conviction?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the weight of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he is as pure as you say, then why\Nwon't he take up his sword and help us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he allow himself to be\Nreduced to such a pathetic state?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and shackle you to these hinterlands?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what I heard is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he killed the Pontifex\Nfor the sake of the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it is his duty to join\Nthem at the Eastern Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and defend the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I cannot go with you\Nto assist in the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can no longer wield my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you and I cross swords now, I\Ndoubt I would last three strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I will not press you further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bid you farewell, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were my mentor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as long as I live, I shall\Nnever forget all you have taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.43,0:22:05.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.96,0:22:12.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur5\c&H0E0E29&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 2,0:22:05.96,0:22:12.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur5\c&H0E0E29&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.96,0:22:13.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you to bed, shall we?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.19,0:22:18.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur5\c&H0E0E29&}Memories of the days we spent together that were so bright
