Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.03,0:22:43.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.76,0:22:52.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.97,0:23:00.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}Pieces of love are still left all over my body
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.69,0:23:09.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5}My only wish, my only wish is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's wrong?
